[CHANGE] benchmark_3/parts/semver_solver_multi/lib/semver_core.py: Implement SemVerError/InvalidVersionError as mutable dataclass exceptions with message __str__ and args, and concretely realize Version (is_prerelease, canonical format(), __str__) plus decorated VersionEngine protocol stubs.
[CHANGE] benchmark_3/parts/semver_solver_multi/lib/semver_core_impl.py: Realize VersionEngine: regex SemVer 2.0.0 grammar validation raising InvalidVersionError with raw_text (leading zeroes, missing components, bad prerelease), and precedence comparison with numeric core ordering, normal-over-prerelease ranking, numeric-below-alphanumeric prerelease identifiers, ASCII lexicographic tie-breaks, longer-sequence ranking, and build metadata ignored.
[CHANGE] benchmark_3/parts/semver_solver_multi/lib/semver_range.py: Implement InvalidRangeError as mutable dataclass exception carrying raw_range, concretely realize VersionRange (frozen record, __str__ delegating to raw_text), and declare RangeEngine protocol stubs with framework decorators.
[CHANGE] benchmark_3/parts/semver_solver_multi/lib/semver_range_impl.py: Realize RangeEngine: whitespace-trimming range parser rejecting empty input, commas, empty union clauses, and bare partials, with caching of compiled disjunctive-normal-form comparator sets. Expands basic comparators, wildcards (>=1.x, !=1.x, >1.*, >=*, x/X/*), caret (first non-zero boundary), tilde (minor boundary), hyphen ranges (1.0.0 - 2.x -> >=1.0.0 <3.0.0), whitespace-delimited conjunction, and '||' unions; satisfies applies precedence comparators plus prerelease filtering that allows explicitly targeted prereleases.
[CHANGE] benchmark_3/parts/semver_solver_multi/lib/dependency_solver.py: Implement PackageNotFoundError and ResolutionConflictError as mutable dataclass exceptions with structured attributes, concretely realize PackageDependency, PackageRelease, ResolutionOutcome frozen records, and declare PackageRepository/DependencySolver protocol stubs with framework decorators.
[CHANGE] benchmark_3/parts/semver_solver_multi/lib/dependency_solver_impl.py: Realize PackageRepository (descending-precedence sorted release storage, shallow-copy get_releases raising PackageNotFoundError, membership and name-set queries) and DependencySolver (depth-first backtracking with Minimum Remaining Values selection tied lexically, descending precedence value ordering, forward checking of candidate dependencies against partial assignment, undo of introduced constraints, conflict trail collection, ResolutionConflictError with conflicting_packages and explanation including missing packages, and ResolutionOutcome compilation).
[CHANGE] benchmark_3/parts/semver_solver_multi/pretense/semver_core_pretense.py: Implement SemVer core pretense state machine: model Version formatting/parsing/prerelease and precedence comparison, synthesized fake factory, fixed fake coverage scenarios, and Hypothesis fake fuzzing.
